WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.887
Speech is now in beta on Suno,

00:00:01.887 --> 00:00:03.773
and this is a pretty different

00:00:03.773 --> 00:00:05.220
kind of feature for us.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.090
Until now, almost everything you

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.720
made in Suno started with music.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.953
With speech, you can create spoken

00:00:10.953 --> 00:00:13.006
audio with a voice performing your

00:00:13.006 --> 00:00:15.240
words with tone, pacing, and emotion,

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.758
while Suno creates the

00:00:16.758 --> 00:00:18.220
background music along with it.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.486
And if you want clean speech without the music,

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:22.440
you can turn the background music off too.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.161
Now you can do things like narration,

00:00:25.161 --> 00:00:27.587
spoken word, stories, voiceovers,

00:00:27.587 --> 00:00:29.940
character pieces, announcements,

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.760
and a bunch of things we probably

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:32.880
haven't even thought of yet.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.340
Let me show you how this works.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.840
You'll find speech right here inside Create.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.940
Speech is available on mobile too.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.111
I'm going to be doing most of this demo on web,

00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:42.900
but I'm going to switch over to my phone.
